Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||11-30-2001||03:06 PM||||Soup- yup... that is simply a PhotoShop rendering.  Too bad, huh?  Don't worry, you're not the first to ask about it!<P>There has been a great amount of discussion as to whether or not the Erebuni corp MR2 nose would be a near bolt-on setup.  But no one seems to have the extra $500 laying around to try it.  If only we were rich (but then I suppose we'd all be hanging out on the Ferrari forum- and wouldn't care about the nose at all!).<P>Anyway- do a search in General discussion for MR2 Shogun nose and you should be albe to read through most of the speculation!<P>BTW: switch your &lt;&gt; to [] and the image will show up (the forum uses UBB code instead of HTML)<P>------------------<BR>               <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 11-30-2001).]||||reg||1
